==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Pineco|1}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Pineco}}.
*'''Hang Down''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Secret Wonders|Shuppet|110}} from the {{TCG|Secret Wonders}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

